{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s02e04-scene-06",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "サインはきっと絶望の近く  (The Sign Comes Near Despair)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kuroki": "黒木",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "reika": "麗華"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back at the studio, a shaken Muranishi brushes off questions about Kuroki's new film. The next day, when the shy newcomer freezes at her debut shoot, Kuroki steps in to comfort her.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "おかえりなさい。新作の構想はどうです？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今はそれどころじゃない。そのうち考える。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "お疲れさまです。見に来ましたの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "どうされました？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "いざとなると、どうしていいか分からなくなって…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "エクスタシーを優先させればいいんですわ。ありのままで挑めば大丈夫ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "でも最初の一歩を踏み出すのは難しいですよね。私もそうでした。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "じゃあ、どうやって乗り切ったんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "サインが来るんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "誰にでも一歩踏み出すべき時には、今だってお知らせが来るの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "じゃあ、今じゃないですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "そうね。サインはきっと絶望の近くよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "おかえりなさい。新作の構想はどうです？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Welcome back. How is the concept for the new film coming along?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今はそれどころじゃない。そのうち考える。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now isn't the time for that. I'll think about it eventually.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "お疲れさまです。見に来ましたの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello everyone. I came by to watch today's shoot.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "どうされました？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is the matter?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "いざとなると、どうしていいか分からなくなって…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now that the moment is here, I don't know what to do anymore...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "エクスタシーを優先させればいいんですわ。ありのままで挑めば大丈夫ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Simply put ecstasy first. If you face it just as you are, you will be fine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "でも最初の一歩を踏み出すのは難しいですよね。私もそうでした。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, taking that very first step is hard, isn't it? It was the same for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "じゃあ、どうやって乗り切ったんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then how did you manage to get past it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "サインが来るんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A sign comes to you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "誰にでも一歩踏み出すべき時には、今だってお知らせが来るの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For everyone, when it's truly time to take a step forward, a notice arrives saying now is the moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "じゃあ、今じゃないですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then... right now isn't that moment, is it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "そうね。サインはきっと絶望の近くよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Perhaps so. The sign surely waits close to despair.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "おかえりなさい。新作の構想はどうです？",
